e: Number of Views of Overview Pages\nDescription: The following issue has been fixed: Number of views is missing for overview pages restored from trash.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2023-11-23\nValid as Of: 2023-11-30\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3808 ---\nComponent: SAP Build Work Zone, advanced edition\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Private Folders Available for Selection\nDescription: Private folders are available for selection in the following widgets: Content, Image, Slideshow, Multimedia, Rotating Banner.   Only users who have access to a private folder can access the widgets that include a private folder.  This feature is already available on preview systems.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\",344\n591,\"--- Record 3011 ---\nComponent: Mobile Services\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Cloud Build removed for SAP Mobile Cards\nDescription: (Version: 2404) Mobile Cloud Build has been removed from the Mobile Card Kit (MCK), and therefore removed form the SAP Mobile Cards user interface and documentation.  See:    Configuring and Building Apps      Supported Build Types, Client Types, Packaging Details, and Build Options      Creating a Build Job    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-04-16\nValid as Of: 2024-05-01\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3012 ---\nComponent: Mobile Services\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Doc Update: Offline user interface improvements\nDescription: (Version: 2404) Additional information has been provided about using the check_repeatable_requests and also using any of the send_standard_repeatability or  send_origin_repeatability properties. When the check_repeatable_requests property is enabled, both the send_origin_repeatability and the send_standard_repeatability properties are ineffective and